  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.1.0 in lockstep. Fixes: the multi-recipient maximum is enforced as 55 up front with a clear message (the format-implied uint16 key-parameters cap; previously 56+ recipients failed late with a confusing header error); the content key is zeroed even when key wrapping or header construction fails; the unwrap path zeroes its temporary ML-KEM/X25519 private-key copies after last use; decryption progress reports the exact plaintext total (Fraction now reaches 1.0). No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
